#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A GUI-first rental website theme for apartments, rooms, villas, and multi-unit holiday properties. Works with MultiRent Companion to manage rental units, apartment images, amenities, homepage hero content, contact and local-information pages, top menus, color schemes, review shortcodes, recommended plugins, and in-admin README help without editing theme files. Includes a fixed visible header, ready-made apartment listing templates, featured-image support, responsive layouts, and starter content for no-code setup."
msgstr ""

